[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12602.309, "timestamp": "03:30:02", "text": "。 そう、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12605.67, "timestamp": "03:30:05", "text": "私の場合は、騙されやすいところがあるんです。 私もまるで開いた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12608.71, "timestamp": "03:30:08", "text": "百科事典みたいで、それは良くないことだ。   あまり公の場で"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12614.229, "timestamp": "03:30:14", "text": "しゃべりすぎるべきではない。 私はふざけて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12616.389, "timestamp": "03:30:16", "text": "痛い目に遭ってしまいました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12619.75, "timestamp": "03:30:19", "text": "。 ええと、今の状況は分かっていますが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12623.83, "timestamp": "03:30:23", "text": "ええ、発言にはもっと気をつけなければなりませんが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12625.59, "timestamp": "03:30:25", "text": "ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12627.83, "timestamp": "03:30:27", "text": "これは言えると思いますが、ええ、荷物は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12631.03, "timestamp": "03:30:31", "text": "実際には満杯です。 重量バランスを取る必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12633.91, "timestamp": "03:30:33", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12638.71, "timestamp": "03:30:38", "text": "計算や学習の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12640.469, "timestamp": "03:30:40", "text": "進捗状況はどうですか？   えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12643.19, "timestamp": "03:30:43", "text": "空間認識の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12644.95, "timestamp": "03:30:44", "text": "テストをやってるんです。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12647.351, "timestamp": "03:30:47", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/dv90XtfhAurw8gTgzar4DAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/dv90XtfhAurw8gTgzar4DAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/dv90XtfhAurw8gTgzar4DA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12648.79, "timestamp": "03:30:48", "text": "大変だけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12652.71, "timestamp": "03:30:52", "text": "日本に着いたら頑張ろうと思ってるよ。"}]